<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia Bank BDNI first-half net up.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Bank BDNI first-half net up.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-08-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net interest income	     187.00 vs 149.90</p>
<p>    Other operating income	   65.90 vs  48.30</p>
<p>    Total operating expenses	153.50 vs 109.30</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		    105.90 vs  95.30</p>
<p>    Net profit			   74.00 vs  68.30</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)	180 vs  166</p>
<p>Note: The consolidated results are unaudited. PT Bank Dagang Nasional Indonesia is privately run.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
